id: pawn-caste
name: Pawn
order: 6
optionOf: caste-combat
optionEffect: 3
# Pieces of the Hive's Pawn chosen: this one.
follows: pawn
description: >
  Use the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. This Attacking Maneuver gains the Full Wager Advantage. If you are a Minion, ignore the Single Attack rule for this Attacking Maneuver. If you are not a Minion, this Attacking Maneuver also gains 2 ranks of the Power Shot Advantage.
text: >
  Pawn [Triggered/Defeat]: Use the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. This Attacking Maneuver gains the Full Wager Advantage. If you are a Minion, ignore the Single Attack rule for this Attacking Maneuver. If you are not a Minion, this Attacking Maneuver also gains 2 ranks of the Power Shot Advantage.

---

# Chosen on the Defeated card: the Basic Attack offered there - Full Wager, and Power Shot (2) but for a Minion (chat.mjs castePawnStrike).
[triggered/defeated, outOfSequence, effect 3]
castePawnStrike();
